{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/3dcd8c284fdcdc2619ea869b096b5c9c.avif?t=1768162343\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/7065c69cf66f86ef51f648c4c211091a.poster.avif?t=1768162343\" width=406 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/7065c69cf66f86ef51f648c4c211091a.webm?t=1768162343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/7065c69cf66f86ef51f648c4c211091a.mp4?t=1768162343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i><br><br>Anxiety Arcade</i></strong> is a short, surreal narrative game about living with anxiety \u2014 and how it feels when your own thoughts turn into puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room is a song in an album \u2014 each puzzle another step deeper into your own head. <br>Bleak, funny, and bizarre, <i>Anxiety Arcade</i> looks at anxiety\u00a0through the lens of those that experience it, rather than trying yo fix it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally built as a full-sized arcade cabinet installation, Anxiety Arcade has been reimagined as a compact digital story about looping thoughts, isolation, and the moments of clarity in the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/6afe382eb1fdbe320872260048e5b1a1.avif?t=1768162343\" width=1200 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/d8e0c29158c3009419078dd944e94a8b.poster.avif?t=1768162343\" width=726 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/d8e0c29158c3009419078dd944e94a8b.webm?t=1768162343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/d8e0c29158c3009419078dd944e94a8b.mp4?t=1768162343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 20\u201330 minute single-session narrative</strong> designed to be played in one sitting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-inspired mini-games</strong> and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal narrative world</strong> that blends humour and melancholy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets to</strong>\u00a0discover on replay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack by Jack The Robot.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Closed Forum</strong>, made possible thanks to public funding from the National Lottery through Arts Council England.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to retro video games and the chaos of the human mind, <i>Anxiety Arcade</i> invites you to stop, breathe, and press X to start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gone Fishin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114990/94761154c6541667de740f4937dab161c76cea28.jpg"},{"name":"Procrastinate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114990/77a9bb1e2abfef74fe73a8e1b1651b09d10ad707.jpg"},{"name":"Stay clean","path":"http